stone-200 rounded-md\">地域: 小樽・朝里川温泉</span>\n    <span class=\"px-2 py-1 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-md\">更新日: 2026年最新版</span>\n    <span class=\"px-2 py-1 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-md\">即時予約・公式連携</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n  \n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！テーマ別＆全国厳選特集</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900\">💎 人気のテーマ別キラー特集</h4>\n      \n    <a href=\"/posts/ise-lobster-abalone-seafood-gourmet-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 伊勢海老・鮑・金目鯛が美味しいおすすめ温泉宿10選！\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/fireworks-view-room-lake-bay-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 花火が見える部屋・宿おすすめホテル10選！特等席比較\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/cave-bath-geothermal-secret-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 洞窟風呂が凄いおすすめ温泉宿10選！天然岩窟温泉\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/milky-emerald-sulfur-hotspring-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 乳白色・エメラルドにごり湯温泉宿おすすめ10選！硫黄泉\n    </a>